# Close-ups of prop textures, stage 2: the tile relief of the atlases (wood, cloth, iron) seen up close in daylight.
# Run with the props' content root and with the root of the earlier bake; OPENGOTHIC_CENSUS=<absolute out>/census.json.
# Spots of own-mesh-{barrel,crate,table,mob,chest} and of the market set; the hero is parked below the world.
# A shot is written at the end of its frame: wait after it before the camera moves on.
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
overlay off
ui off
view nopfx
cam lift off
# barrel view
goto pos 5391 -1680 -5822
clear 3000
cam look 2000
cam cut
cam world 280 2120 0
wait 34
cam hold
wait 4000
shot barrel_view
wait 300
